-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data in this repository
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- services/conductor/tests/fixtures/boc/: USD/CAD exchange rates from the Bank
  of Canada Valet API (https://www.bankofcanada.ca/valet/), used as a test
  fixture. Source: Bank of Canada.
- services/research/fixtures/kraken-markets.json and
  services/conductor/tests/fixtures/freqtrade/: public market metadata from
  Kraken's public API and recorded responses of a dry-run Freqtrade instance.
- No historical price data is included. Backtest data is downloaded by each
  user from the exchange (docs/05-adr/0020-kraken-archive-for-backtest-history.md)
  under that exchange's terms.
